[{"id":"MTM4-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Ion berikut ini, manakah yang mempunyai elektron lebih banyak daripada proton dan lebih banyak proton daripada neutron? <img alt=\"\\small [H =^1 H; D =^2 H; He^4 He; O^{16} O]\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5BH%20%3D%5E1%20H%3B%20D%20%3D%5E2%20H%3B%20He%5E4%20He%3B%20O%5E%7B16%7D%20O%5D\" /></p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small D-\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20D-\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","<img alt=\"\\small D_3O^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20D_3O%5E&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","<img alt=\"\\small He^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20He%5E&amp;plus;\" />","<img alt=\"\\small OD\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20OD\" /></p><p><strong>E</strong>. <img alt=\"\\small OH^-\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20OH%5E-\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTcyNQ"},{"id":"MTM4-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Energi ionisasi berturutan (dalam <img alt=\"\\small kJ.mol^{-1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20kJ.mol%5E%7B-1%7D\" />) dari unsur X berikut ini adalah : 870, 1800, 3000, 3600, 5800, 7000, 13200</p><p>Apakah unsur X ini:</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small _{33}As\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20_%7B33%7DAs\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","<img alt=\"\\small _{53}I\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20_%7B53%7DI\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","<img alt=\"\\small _8O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20_8O\" />","<img alt=\"\\small _{52}Te\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20_%7B52%7DTe\" />","<img alt=\"\\small _{40}Zr.\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20_%7B40%7DZr.\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTczNg"},{"id":"MTM4-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Nilai perubahan entalpi (DH) untuk proses perubahan yang digambarkan oleh persamaan:</p><p><img alt=\"\\small Na(s)\\rightarrow Na^+(g) + e^-,\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Na%28s%29%5Crightarrow%20Na%5E&amp;plus;%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20e%5E-%2C\" /></p><p>Adalah sama dengan :</p>","choices":["energi ionisasi pertama natrium.","Perubahan entalpi penguapan natrium","Jumlah energi ionisasi pertama dan afinitas elektron natrium.","Jumlah perubahan entalpi atomisasi dan energi ionisasi pertama natrium.","Jumlah perubahan entalpi atomisasi dan afinitas elektron natrium."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTc0Mg"},{"id":"MTM4-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Tabel berikut ini menunjukkan tingkat oksidasi yang mungkin dari lima unsur blok-d dalam tabel periodik unsur (unsur diwakili oleh huruf yang bukan simbolnya).</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423043601.PNG\" style=\"height:135px; width:400px\" /></p><p>Berdasarkan data tersebut, manakah ion berikut ini yang paling mungkin keberadaanya?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small PO_{2^{+}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20PO_%7B2%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D%7D\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","<img alt=\"\\small QO_{3^-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20QO_%7B3%5E-%7D\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","<img alt=\"\\small RO_{4^{2-}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20RO_%7B4%5E%7B2-%7D%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\small SO_{4^-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20SO_%7B4%5E-%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\small TO_{2^{2+}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20TO_%7B2%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D%7D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTc1NA"},{"id":"MTM4-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Kalor yang dibebaskan dalam reaksi netralisasi di bawah ini adalah -114 kJ</p><p><img alt=\"\\small 2NaOH(aq) + H_2SO_4(aq) \\rightarrow Na_2SO_4(aq) + 2H_2O(l)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202NaOH%28aq%29%20&amp;plus;%20H_2SO_4%28aq%29%20%5Crightarrow%20Na_2SO_4%28aq%29%20&amp;plus;%202H_2O%28l%29\" /></p><p>Dengan menggunakan informasi ini, berapakah nilai yang paling mendekati untuk kalor yang dibebaskan dalam netralisasi berikut ini?</p><p><img alt=\"\\small Ba(OH)_2(aq) + 2HCl(aq) \\rightarrow BaCl_2(aq) + 2H_2O(l)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Ba%28OH%29_2%28aq%29%20&amp;plus;%202HCl%28aq%29%20%5Crightarrow%20BaCl_2%28aq%29%20&amp;plus;%202H_2O%28l%29\" /></p>","choices":["-57 kJ&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","-76 kJ&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","-114 kJ","-171 kJ","-228 kJ"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTc2Mg"},{"id":"MTM4-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan diagram energi potensial berikut ini:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423044153.PNG\" style=\"height:122px; width:329px\" /></p><p>Mengenai ilustrasi diatas, manakah pernyataan yang <strong>BENAR</strong>:</p>","choices":["Reaksi A adalah eksoterm sedangkan reaksi B adalah endoterm","Reaksi A adalah endoterm sedangkan reaksai B adalah eksoterm.","Reaksi A adalah yang mungkin paling spontan sedangkan reaksi B adalah yang mungkin tidak spontan.","Reaksi A membebaskan panas sedangkan reaksi B menyerap panas.","Tidak ada pernyataan yang benar."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTc2NQ"},{"id":"MTM4-q07","number":7,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Manakah gaya antar-molekul yang <em>paling kuat </em>didalam molekul <img alt=\"\\small CH_2Cl_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_2Cl_2\" />? A.Gaya dispersi London</p><p>B. Dipole-dipole</p><p>C. Ikatan Hydrogen</p><p>D. Gaya Van der Waals</p><p>E. Bukan salah satu diatas</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTc2Ng"},{"id":"MTM4-q08","number":8,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa berikut ini, manakah yang paling sukar larut dalam <img alt=\"\\small CCl_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CCl_4\" /> cair?</p><p><strong>A. <img alt=\"\\small NH_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_3\" /></strong></p><p>B. <img alt=\"\\small CH_3-CH_2-CH_2-CH_2-CH_2-CH_2-CH_2-CH_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3-CH_2-CH_2-CH_2-CH_2-CH_2-CH_2-CH_3\" /></p><p>C. <img alt=\"\\small CO_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CO_2\" /></p><p>D. <img alt=\"\\small I_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20I_2\" /></p><p>E. <img alt=\"\\small CH_3-CH_2-CH_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3-CH_2-CH_3\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTc2Nw"},{"id":"MTM4-q09","number":9,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Kurva manakah yang menunjukkan grafik yang benar dari <em>pV </em>terhadap <em>p </em>untuk sejumlah massa tertentu suatu gas ideal pada temperatur konstan?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423044532.PNG\" style=\"height:120px; width:493px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTc3Mg"},{"id":"MTM4-q10","number":10,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diagram dibawah ini adalah representasi model 2-dimensi contoh air pada temperatur tertentu .</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423044723.PNG\" style=\"height:131px; width:138px\" /></p><p>Berikut ini, diagram manakah yang merupakan diagram paling tepat (terbaik) untuk merepresentasikan sistem yang sama sesudah penambahan sukrosa <img alt=\"\\small (C_{12}H_{22}O_{11})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%28C_%7B12%7DH_%7B22%7DO_%7B11%7D%29\" />?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423044744.PNG\" style=\"height:266px; width:269px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTc4MA"},{"id":"MTM4-q11","number":11,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Jika 75,0 mL larutan 0,250 M HNO3 dan 70.0 mL larutan 0,250 M KOH dicampurkan, berapakah molaritas dari garam ini di dalam larutan yang dihasilkan?</p>","choices":["0,250 M","0,500 M","0,333 M","0,125 M","0,167 M</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTgxMQ"},{"id":"MTM4-q12","number":12,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Zat cair berikut ini mempunyai massa molar yang mirip. Berdasarkan data tekanan uap pada <img alt=\"\\small 20^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%2020%5EoC\" /> yang diberikan, ramalkan mana zat cair yang attraksi antar-molekul paling lemah.</p>","choices":["Asam Asetat (tekanan uap = 14 mm Hg)","ethyl chlorida (tekanan uap = 1050 mm Hg)","ethyl methyl ether (tekanan uap = 1260 mm Hg)","butana (tekanan uap = 1550 mm Hg)","isopropyl alkcohol (tekanan uap = 35 mm Hg)"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTgxMg"},{"id":"MTM4-q13","number":13,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan kesetimbangan berikut :</p><p><img alt=\"\\small 2SO_2 + O_2 \\leftrightharpoons 2SO_3 .\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202SO_2%20&amp;plus;%20O_2%20%5Cleftrightharpoons%202SO_3%20.\" /></p><p>dimana semua komponen gas berada pada <img alt=\"\\small 2000^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202000%5EoC\" />:</p><p>Dimisalkan bahwa 10,0 mol <img alt=\"\\small SO_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20SO_2\" />dan 8,0 mol <img alt=\"\\small O_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20O_2\" /> dimasukkan ke dalam wadah 1 L dan didiamkan hingga tercapai kesetimbangan. Sesudah cukup waktu untuk mencapai kondisi kesetimbangan,ternyata diperoleh 4,0 mol <img alt=\"\\small SO_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20SO_3\" />. Berapa konsentrasi dari <img alt=\"\\small SO_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20SO_2\" /> dan <img alt=\"\\small O_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20O_2\" /> dalam kesetimbangan?</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small Keduanya,SO_2 \\: \\: dan \\: \\: O_2 = 4,0 M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Keduanya%2CSO_2%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20dan%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20O_2%20%3D%204%2C0%20M\" />","<img alt=\"\\small SO_2 = 6,0 M\\: dan \\: O_2 = 4,0 M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20SO_2%20%3D%206%2C0%20M%5C%3A%20dan%20%5C%3A%20O_2%20%3D%204%2C0%20M\" />","<img alt=\"\\small Keduanya, SO_2 \\: \\: dan \\: \\: O_2 = 6,0 M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Keduanya%2C%20SO_2%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20dan%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20O_2%20%3D%206%2C0%20M\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small SO_2 = 14,0 M \\: \\: dan\\: \\: O_2 = 10,0 M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20SO_2%20%3D%2014%2C0%20M%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20dan%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20O_2%20%3D%2010%2C0%20M\" />","<img alt=\"\\small SO_2 = 4,0 M \\: \\: dan \\: \\: O_2 = 14,0 M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20SO_2%20%3D%204%2C0%20M%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20dan%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20O_2%20%3D%2014%2C0%20M\" /></p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTgyMg"},{"id":"MTM4-q14","number":14,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Untuk reaksi berikut ini: <img alt=\"\\small A_{(g)} + B_{(g)} \\rightleftharpoons C_{(g) }+ D_{(g)}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20A_%7B%28g%29%7D%20&amp;plus;%20B_%7B%28g%29%7D%20%5Crightleftharpoons%20C_%7B%28g%29%20%7D&amp;plus;%20D_%7B%28g%29%7D\" /> , dalam wadah 1 L konsentrasi gas-gas ini dalam campuran kesetimbangan adalah: [A] = 0,5M , [B] = 4,0 M , [C] = 6,0 M , dan [D] = 8,0 M. Berapa mol D harus ditambahkan ke dalam campuran ini untuk mencapai konsentrasi A = 1,0 M?</p>","choices":["12,1 mol","0,5 mol","0,034 mol","8,034 mol","10,56 mol"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTgyMw"},{"id":"MTM4-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berapakah nila p<em>Ka </em>untuk reaksi:Didalam pelarut air pada temperatur <img alt=\"25^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?25%5EoC\" /> terjadi kesetimbangan:<img alt=\"\\small NH_{3(aq)}+ H_2O_{(l)} \\rightleftharpoons NH_{4^+}_{(aq)}+ OH^-_{(aq) },\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_%7B3%28aq%29%7D&amp;plus;%20H_2O_%7B%28l%29%7D%20%5Crightleftharpoons%20NH_%7B4%5E&amp;plus;%7D_%7B%28aq%29%7D&amp;plus;%20OH%5E-_%7B%28aq%29%20%7D%2C\" /> nilai <em><img alt=\"\\small pK_b\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20pK_b\" /></em>adalah 4,8.&nbsp;</p><p>Berapakh Nilai <img alt=\"\\small pk_a\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20pk_a\" /> untuk reaksi</p><p><img alt=\"\\small NH_{4^+}+ H_2O_{(I)} \\rightleftharpoons NH_{3(aq)}+ H_3O^{+}_{(aq)}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_%7B4%5E&amp;plus;%7D&amp;plus;%20H_2O_%7B%28I%29%7D%20%5Crightleftharpoons%20NH_%7B3%28aq%29%7D&amp;plus;%20H_3O%5E%7B&amp;plus;%7D_%7B%28aq%29%7D\" /> pada temperatur ini?</p>","choices":["-4,8&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","2,2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","4,8","9,2","11,8"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTgyOQ"},{"id":"MTM4-q16","number":16,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini adalah reaksi asam hipoklorit (HOCl) dengan air :</p><p><img alt=\"\\small HOCl + H_2O \\rightleftharpoons H_3O^+ + OCl^-\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20HOCl%20&amp;plus;%20H_2O%20%5Crightleftharpoons%20H_3O%5E&amp;plus;%20&amp;plus;%20OCl%5E-\" /></p><p>Apa pengaruhnya bila kedalam larutan asam hipoklorit ditambahkan sejumlah natrium</p><p>hipoklorit (NaOCl) terhadap reaksi kesetimbangan tersebut?</p>","choices":["Konsentrasi HOCl dan <img alt=\"\\small H_3O^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20H_3O%5E&amp;plus;\" /> akan bertambah.","Konsentrasi HOCl dan <img alt=\"\\small H_3O^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20H_3O%5E&amp;plus;\" /> akan berkurang","Konsentrasi HOCl akan bertambah dan konsentrasi <img alt=\"\\small H_3O^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20H_3O%5E&amp;plus;\" /> akan berkurang.","Konsentrasi HOCl akan berkurang dan konsntrasi <img alt=\"\\small H_3O^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20H_3O%5E&amp;plus;\" /> akan bertambah.","Tidak akan ada perubahan karena natrium hipoklorit adalah garam tanpa sifat asam atau basa."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTgzOA"},{"id":"MTM4-q17","number":17,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Kesadahan dalam air kran dapat ditentukan dengan titrasi sampel terhadap pereaksi yang membentuk ion kompleks dengan ion logam yang larut. Indikator untuk metoda titrasi ini memerlukan penjagaan pH larutan sekitar 10. Berikut ini, manakah larutan akua yang dapat digunakan untuk melakukan ini?</p>","choices":["ammonia dan ammonium klorida","ammonium klorida dan asam hidroklorida.","Natrium etanoat dan asam etanoat.","Natrium hidroksida dan natrium etanoat.","Hanya natrium saja."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTgzOQ"},{"id":"MTM4-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu eksperimen dibuat untuk mengukur laju hidrolisis metil etanoat</p><p><img alt=\"\\small CH_3CO_2CH_3 + H_2O \\rightarrow CH_3CO_2H + CH_3OH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3CO_2CH_3%20&amp;plus;%20H_2O%20%5Crightarrow%20CH_3CO_2H%20&amp;plus;%20CH_3OH\" /></p><p>Hidrolisis ditemukan berjalan lambat dalam larutan akua netral tetapi reaksi ini mencapai laju yang terukur bila larutan ini diasamkan dengan asam hidroklorida. Apakah fungsi asam hidroklorida dalam reaksi campuran ini?</p>","choices":["menaikkan laju reaksi dengan aksi katalitik.","Untuk meyakinkan bahwa reaksi ini mencapai kesetimbangan.","Untuk menjaga pH konstan selama reaksi ini.","Untuk menekan ionisasi dari terbentuknya asam etanoat.","Untuk melarutkan metil etanoat."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg0MA"},{"id":"MTM4-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bila kedalam larutan jenuh perak chlorida (AgCl) ditambahkan sejumlah padatan AgCl (Ksp = 1,8 x 10-10) akan menyebabkan:</p>","choices":["Konsentrasi ion Cl- menjadi lebih besar dibandingkan dalam larutan jenuhnya.","Tidak ada perubahan konsntrasi ion Cl-","Konsentrasi ion Cl- dan Ag+ lebih besar dibandingkan dengan larutan jenuhnya.","Konsentrasi ion Cl- dan Ag+ lebih kecil dibandingkan dengan larutan jenuhnya.","Konsentrasi ion Cl- menjadi lebih besar dibandingkan dalam larutan jenuhnya"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg0MQ"},{"id":"MTM4-q20","number":20,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Untuk reaksi berikut ini, <img alt=\"\\small 2 NO + Br_2 \\rightarrow 2 NOBr_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%20NO%20&amp;plus;%20Br_2%20%5Crightarrow%202%20NOBr_2\" />, laju reaksi ini dapat dinyatakan sebagai:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423052520.PNG\" style=\"height:218px; width:116px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg0Mg"},{"id":"MTM4-q21","number":21,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berapa konstanta laju untuk reaksi order pertama <img alt=\"\\small A \\rightarrow B\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20A%20%5Crightarrow%20B\" /> , diberikan data berikut ini:</p><p><em>Waktu (s) | [A]</em></p><p><em>0 | 1,76</em></p><p><em>6 | 0,88</em></p><p><em>12 | 0,44</em></p><p><em>18 | 0,22</em></p>","choices":["0,23","1,0","&nbsp;0,17","&nbsp;0,12","tidak dapat ditentukan</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg0Mw"},{"id":"MTM4-q22","number":22,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Propelan padat yang dipakai dalam pendorong roket untuk&lsquo;space shuttle&rsquo; adalah suatu campuran aluminium dan senyawa X. Senyawa X mengandung klor dengan tingkat oksidasi +7. Berikut ini, manakah yang merupakan senyawa X?</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small NCl_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NCl_3\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","<img alt=\"\\small NH_4Cl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_4Cl\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","<img alt=\"\\small NH_4ClO_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_4ClO_3\" />","<img alt=\"\\small NH_4ClO_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_4ClO_4\" />","<img alt=\"\\small N_2H_5Cl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20N_2H_5Cl\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg0NA"},{"id":"MTM4-q23","number":23,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Ion etandioat, <img alt=\"\\small C_2O_{4^{2-}}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20C_2O_%7B4%5E%7B2-%7D%7D\" />, dioksidasi dalam suasana asam oleh kalium manganat(VII) menurut persamaan berikut:</p><p><img alt=\"\\small 2MnO_4^-_{(aq)}+5C_2O_{4^{2-}}(aq)\\rightarrow 2Mn^{2+}_{(aq)}+10CO_{2(g)}+8H_2O(I)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202MnO_4%5E-_%7B%28aq%29%7D&amp;plus;5C_2O_%7B4%5E%7B2-%7D%7D%28aq%29%5Crightarrow%202Mn%5E%7B2&amp;plus;%7D_%7B%28aq%29%7D&amp;plus;10CO_%7B2%28g%29%7D&amp;plus;8H_2O%28I%29\" /></p><p>Berapa volume larutan 0,020 mol/L kalium manganat(VII) yang dibutuhkan untuk mengoksidasi sempurna 1,0x10-3 mol garam <img alt=\"\\small KHC_2O_4.H_2C_2O_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20KHC_2O_4.H_2C_2O_4\" />?</p>","choices":["20 mL","40 mL","50 mL","125 mL","250 mL</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg0NQ"},{"id":"MTM4-q24","number":24,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam larutan asam, ion <img alt=\"\\small MnO_{4^-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20MnO_%7B4%5E-%7D\" /> mengoksidasi ion <img alt=\"\\small Cl^-\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Cl%5E-\" /> menjadi <img alt=\"\\small Cl_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Cl_2\" />. Nilai <em>E</em>&deg; untuk reaksi adalah +0,16 V. Pernyataan atau persamaan manakah berikut ini yang benar?</p>","choices":["Bilangan oksidasi klor berubah dari -1 menjadai +2.","Bilangan oksidasi mangan beribah dari +7 menjadai +4.","<img alt=\"\\small 2MnO_{4^-} + 2Cl^- \\rightarrow 2MnO_{4^{2-}} + Cl_2 .\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202MnO_%7B4%5E-%7D%20&amp;plus;%202Cl%5E-%20%5Crightarrow%202MnO_%7B4%5E%7B2-%7D%7D%20&amp;plus;%20Cl_2%20.\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\\small 2MnO_{4^-} + 8H^+ + 6Cl^- \\rightarrow 2MnO_2 + 4H_2O + 3Cl_2.\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202MnO_%7B4%5E-%7D%20&amp;plus;%208H%5E&amp;plus;%20&amp;plus;%206Cl%5E-%20%5Crightarrow%202MnO_2%20&amp;plus;%204H_2O%20&amp;plus;%203Cl_2.\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\\small 2MnO_{4^-} + 16H^- + 10Cl^- \\rightarrow 2Mn_2+ + 8H_2O + 5Cl_2.\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202MnO_%7B4%5E-%7D%20&amp;plus;%2016H%5E-%20&amp;plus;%2010Cl%5E-%20%5Crightarrow%202Mn_2&amp;plus;%20&amp;plus;%208H_2O%20&amp;plus;%205Cl_2.\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg0Ng"},{"id":"MTM4-q25","number":25,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini, ditunjukkan empat isomer <img alt=\"\\small C_6H_{12}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20C_6H_%7B12%7D\" /> :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423055626.PNG\" style=\"height:79px; width:400px\" /></p><p>Pasangan berikut ini, manakah yang merupakan pasangan isomer <em>cis-trans</em>?</p>","choices":["1 dan 2","1 dan 3","1 dan 4","2 dan 4","3 dan 4"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg0Nw"},{"id":"MTM4-q26","number":26,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu senyawa ester metil asetat jika direduksi akan menghasilkan etanol, pereduksi yang dapat dipakai adalah:</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small NaBH_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NaBH_4\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","<img alt=\"\\small H_2, Ni\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20H_2%2C%20Ni\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;","<img alt=\"\\small HCl, Fe\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20HCl%2C%20Fe\" />","<img alt=\"\\small LiAlH_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20LiAlH_4\" />","<img alt=\"\\small SnCl_2.\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20SnCl_2.\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg0OA"},{"id":"MTM4-q27","number":27,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu senyawa dikatakan aromatis apabila dapat memenuhi aturan Hϋckel (4n + 2 ). Dibawah ini, manakah senyawa yang merupakan senyawa anti-aromatis.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423055924.PNG\" style=\"height:241px; width:373px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg0OQ"},{"id":"MTM4-q28","number":28,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Produk yang dihasilkan dari reaksi adisi 1,3-butadiena dengan <img alt=\"\\small Cl_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Cl_2\" /> adalah:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423060206.PNG\" style=\"height:313px; width:391px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg1MA"},{"id":"MTM4-q29","number":29,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Susun urutan berdasarkan kenaikan reaktivitas reaksi substitusi elektrofilik dari senyawa berikut adalah:</p>","choices":["Nitrobenzena &gt; toluena phenol &gt; benzena","Nitrobenzena &gt; phenol &gt; toluena &gt; benzena","Phenol &gt; Toluena &gt; benzena&gt; &gt; nitrobenzena","Toluena &gt; phenol &gt; nitrobenzena &gt; benzena","Toluena &gt; benzena &gt; phenol &gt; nitrobenzena"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg1MQ"},{"id":"MTM4-q30","number":30,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Produk reaksi yang terbentuk jika siklopentil metil keton direaksikan dengan etilmagnesiumbromida , lalu dihidrolisa dalam suasana basa ,seperti terlihat dalam reaksi di bawah ini adalah:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423060329.PNG\" style=\"height:95px; width:347px\" /></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200423060349.PNG\" style=\"height:281px; width:394px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTg1Mg"}]
